Monitoring & Observability — Familiarity with application and infrastructure metrics, logging, alerting, dashboards, and incident investigation.
Cloud Networking — Understanding of virtual networks, subnets, security controls, routing concepts, and service connectivity.
Containerized Applications — Experience supporting application workloads packaged and deployed as containers.
Release Management — Familiarity with versioned releases, deployment approvals, rollback procedures, environment management, and post-release verification.
